    "preamble": "Sohan Lal vs State (2023:Rj-Jd:41305) on 29 November, 2023",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "2. Learned counsel appearing for the petitioner submits that he will not assail conviction of the petitioner and confine his [2023:RJ-JD:41305] (2 of 3) [CRLR-845/2004] arguments to the alternative prayer of reduction of the sentence awarded by the trial court. He submits that the incident in the present case pertains to the year 1999 and the present criminal revision is pending since the year 2004. The petitioner has already suffered agony of protracted trial. With these submissions, learned counsel prays that by taking a lenient view, the sentence awarded to the petitioner may be reduced to the period already undergone by him.",
